<title>UK: Esprit Telecom unit signs access pact.</title>
<headline>Esprit Telecom unit signs access pact.</headline>
<dateline>READING, U.K. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>European telecommunications company Esprit Telecom Group plc said on Monday that its Dutch operating subsidiary Esprit Telecom Benelux BV had signed a special network access agreement with PTT Telecom in the Netherlands.</p>
<p>The agreement enables Esprit Telecom to provide its telecommunications services to all businesses and consumers throughout the Netherlands, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The service is available immediately, the company added.</p>
</text>
